(Subject: Infringement of the trade mark MILLETTA - cease and desist.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. We act for Aarav Foods Pvt. Ltd. \(our client\). Our client has sold baked millet) Tj
T*
(snacks under the mark MILLETTA since 1 August 2019 and states that the mark is) Tj
T*
(registered in Class 30.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Our client has learned that you are selling baked millet crisps under the mark) Tj
T*
(MILLETO in packs coloured yellow with a green lower band, in your Sunrise Fresh stores) Tj
T*
(in Delhi and elsewhere in the NCR.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
