T*
(\(a\) to stop making, selling and advertising any goods under the mark MILLETO or any mark) Tj
T*
(similar to MILLETTA; \(b\) to withdraw existing stock; \(c\) to disclose your sales of) Tj
T*
(MILLETO to date; and \(d\) to give a written undertaking to that effect.) Tj
T*
() Tj
